    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i try to take breaks but i can't. there's always something needing me. it's like there's no version of the future where things actually get better, just more of this. sometimes i look at my life and i just think... what if i just didn't exist anymore? like, if i could just sleep through all of this and never have to deal with the weight of it ever again. it feels like the only way to actually get some peace.",
